      "parent_id": null,
      "behavior": "For each final PE sum, select its output-column signed INT32 bias from the stable job configuration, add modulo 2^32, then apply max(0,signed result) if ReLU enabled. Forward one result per row-major output position. Hold data/valid during backpressure. Global result selection/column tracking is planned and not verified.",
